 "open_questions": [
  "Keep PANGAEA's 6 index-spaced steps for comparability, or choose steps by calendar date so every model sees the same season?",
  "Should the task also offer the full variable-length series for models built for it (Galileo up to 24 steps, AnySat any length)?",
